  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「ともあれ『三大賞金首』の二人目は、賞金稼ぎにして『賞金首』！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「正体不明！　『名無しの賞金稼ぎ』！　賞金額、５００＄！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「名無しってあるけど、名前わかるよねこれ。バスケ部の、たしか小松ぼたん先輩？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「何で賞金稼ぎ……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「つまり『賞金首』を倒して＄を稼いでるっぽいのに、自分も『賞金首』になっちゃってるんだろ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「何をやらかしたんだろうね、このひと？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「このひとは他の『三大賞金首』とちがって、単独で行動してるみたい。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「だから、狙い目かもしれないね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「他の『三大賞金首』は手下を引きつれてるから、本人に接触するのが難しいもん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「とはいえ、この『名無しの賞金稼ぎ』は目的も不明でどこにいるかわかんない。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「まずは、所在を突きとめるのが大変そうだね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「最後の三人目は、『西部』の奥地で独自の文化と勢力を形成している『西部』の先住民！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「『チアブ族の酋長』！　賞金額は２００＄！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「って、これも名前わかるね。チア部の、日滝ましろ先輩。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「チアブ族って、チア部ってことなのかな……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「他の『三大賞金首』に比べると賞金額が低いけど、このチアブ族という集団は全員が賞金首になってる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「総合すると、かるく１０００＄にはなる。勢力としては最大規模ってことだね、チアブ族は！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「うん、チアブ族って何だよっていう感じだよね。わたしも同じ気持ちだよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「まぁそういう『設定』なんじゃない、西部劇によく登場する先住民っぽい感じ……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「何でもこのチアブ族、『西部』の基本ルールにも従わずに好き勝手に暮らしてるみたいだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「噂では、『西部』の全域を消し飛ばすほどの『大量破壊兵器』を遺跡から発掘したとかで。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「誰も、チアブ族には手をだせずにいるの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「以上が、転校生くんが標的にすべき『三大賞金首』だよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-sheriff",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sheriff_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「みんな一癖も二癖もありそうだよね～、誰から接触してみる？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「いちおう本拠地がわかってるのが、『隻眼の無法者』と『チアブ族の酋長』だね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「会いに行こうと思えば、すぐ行けるよ」"
